{"seq":19,"slug":"mao-party-building-thought","title":"毛泽东党建思想","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":3,"docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/19_mao-party-building-thought","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"毛泽东党建思想-简介\">毛泽东党建思想 简介</h1><p>毛泽东党建思想是毛泽东思想的重要组成部分，系统回答了在中国这样一个农民占人口绝大多数的半殖民地半封建国家，如何建设一个马克思主义先进政党这一根本问题。毛泽东创造性地提出了思想建党原则、民主集中制的组织原则和批评与自我批评的作风方法，形成了一套完整的无产阶级政党建设理论体系，为中国共产党从弱小走向强大提供了根本的组织保障。</p>\n<p>本 hub 共三章八篇：第一章<strong>理论基础</strong>（<a href=\"theoretical-foundation/ideological-party-building\">思想建党原则</a>、<a href=\"theoretical-foundation/democratic-centralism\">民主集中制</a>、<a href=\"theoretical-foundation/criticism-self-criticism\">批评与自我批评</a>）阐述三大理论支柱；第二章<strong>组织实践</strong>（<a href=\"organizational-practice/mass-line-methodology\">群众路线方法论</a>、<a href=\"organizational-practice/cadre-policy-training\">干部政策与培养</a>、<a href=\"organizational-practice/party-style-construction\">党风建设</a>）展现理论原则如何转化为可操作的组织工作方法；第三章<strong>遗产与发展</strong>（<a href=\"legacy-development/party-building-historical-experience\">党建历史经验总结</a>、<a href=\"legacy-development/contemporary-party-governance\">当代党的治理启示</a>）评析其历史规律与当代价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>「毛泽东研究」分类下各 hub 分工明确，选错入口会浪费大量时间。判断标准很简单：<strong>读党建理论本身，在本 hub；读某篇原著原文，去对应精读 hub；读毛泽东思想的其他分支，去对应分支 hub。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../mao-zedong-thought/\">毛泽东思想核心理论</a></td>\n<td>毛泽东思想整体框架与各分支总览</td>\n<td>提供全景地图；本 hub 只深入&quot;党的建设&quot;这一个分支的完整理论展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../selected-works-of-mao/\">毛泽东选集（四卷）</a></td>\n<td>原著篇目、版本与写作背景</td>\n<td>按篇目组织的文本入口；本 hub 按理论逻辑重组，不逐篇解读原文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../on-contradiction/\">《矛盾论》精读</a></td>\n<td>矛盾分析法原文精读</td>\n<td>本 hub 反复运用矛盾分析（民主与集中、党内矛盾处理），其哲学原文根基在此</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../on-practice/\">《实践论》精读</a></td>\n<td>认识论原文精读</td>\n<td>思想建党与群众路线的认识论源头（实践—认识—再实践）在此精读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../against-book-worship/\">反对本本主义</a></td>\n<td>调查研究方法论单篇精读</td>\n<td>&quot;没有调查，没有发言权&quot;的原文出处；本 hub 将其展开为党风建设的制度安排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../on-coalition-government/\">论联合政府</a></td>\n<td>七大政治报告精读</td>\n<td>三大作风的原始出处文本；本 hub 对三大作风做理论化的系统展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../reform-our-study/\">改造我们的学习</a></td>\n<td>整风运动核心文献精读</td>\n<td>整风的理论纲领原文；本 hub 从建党理论角度系统分析整风运动的前因后果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../mao-military-thought/\">毛泽东军事思想</a></td>\n<td>军事战略理论分支</td>\n<td>平行分支：两 hub 交汇于&quot;党指挥枪&quot;——本 hub 讲党如何建设，该 hub 讲党如何指挥战争</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>政治学 / 党史初学者（无前置要求，按序通读）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"theoretical-foundation/ideological-party-building\">思想建党原则</a>——全部理论的起点，古田会议是理解后续一切的总钥匙</li>\n<li><a href=\"theoretical-foundation/democratic-centralism\">民主集中制</a> → <a href=\"theoretical-foundation/criticism-self-criticism\">批评与自我批评</a>——组织原则与纠错机制</li>\n<li><a href=\"organizational-practice/mass-line-methodology\">群众路线方法论</a> → <a href=\"organizational-practice/party-style-construction\">党风建设</a>——理论如何落地为日常工作方法</li>\n<li><a href=\"legacy-development/party-building-historical-experience\">党建历史经验总结</a> → <a href=\"legacy-development/contemporary-party-governance\">当代党的治理启示</a>——收束为历史全景与当代视野</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>组织管理 / 领导力研究者（可跳读，方法论优先）</strong></p>\n<p>直接从第二章三篇入手（方法论密度最高），遇到&quot;为什么思想教育优先于组织手段&quot;的疑问时回读 <a href=\"theoretical-foundation/ideological-party-building\">思想建党原则</a>；人事制度专题见 <a href=\"organizational-practice/cadre-policy-training\">干部政策与培养</a>，可按需插入；最后以 <a href=\"legacy-development/contemporary-party-governance\">当代党的治理启示</a> 对照现代组织理论。</p>\n<p><strong>已有党史基础的研究者（以纲带目）</strong></p>\n<p>以 <a href=\"legacy-development/party-building-historical-experience\">党建历史经验总结</a> 为纲建立时间线，再按需回读各专题深篇补足机制细节，最后到 <a href=\"../selected-works-of-mao/\">毛泽东选集（四卷）</a> 与 <a href=\"../reform-our-study/\">改造我们的学习</a> 等原著 hub 核对原文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>中国近代史基本脉络（必需）</strong>：半殖民地半封建社会性质、1927 年大革命失败、农村包围城市道路——本 hub 直接使用这些背景事件，不再解释事件本身</li>\n<li><strong>马克思主义基础概念（必需）</strong>：阶级与先锋队、唯物辩证法、认识论的基本术语；术语卡壳时可随时到 <a href=\"../on-practice/\">《实践论》精读</a> 与 <a href=\"../on-contradiction/\">《矛盾论》精读</a> 补课</li>\n<li><strong>不需要</strong>：组织学或管理学专业训练——当代治理启示篇自带与现代管理概念的对照说明</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>若读完本 hub 后想继续深入，推荐两条延伸方向：一是哲学根基——<a href=\"../on-practice/\">《实践论》精读</a> 与 <a href=\"../on-contradiction/\">《矛盾论》精读</a>，本 hub 的认识论与矛盾分析方法全部源出于此；二是原著对照——<a href=\"../against-book-worship/\">反对本本主义</a>、<a href=\"../reform-our-study/\">改造我们的学习</a>、<a href=\"../on-coalition-government/\">论联合政府</a> 三篇精读覆盖了本 hub 引用最密集的三篇原始文献。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theoretical-foundation","title":"理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/theoretical-foundation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ideological-party-building","title":"思想建党原则","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/theoretical-foundation/ideological-party-building"},{"seq":2,"slug":"democratic-centralism","title":"民主集中制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/theoretical-foundation/democratic-centralism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"criticism-self-criticism","title":"批评与自我批评","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/theoretical-foundation/criticism-self-criticism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"organizational-practice","title":"组织实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/organizational-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mass-line-methodology","title":"群众路线方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/organizational-practice/mass-line-methodology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cadre-policy-training","title":"干部政策与培养","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/organizational-practice/cadre-policy-training"},{"seq":3,"slug":"party-style-construction","title":"党风建设","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/organizational-practice/party-style-construction"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"legacy-development","title":"遗产与发展","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/legacy-development","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"party-building-historical-experience","title":"党建历史经验总结","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/legacy-development/party-building-historical-experience"},{"seq":2,"slug":"contemporary-party-governance","title":"当代党的治理启示","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-party-building-thought/legacy-development/contemporary-party-governance"}]}]}